  "notes": "HOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\n・{作製|さくせい} - manufacturing physical objects ({製|せい} = manufacture)\n・{作成|さくせい} - creating documents, plans, software ({成|せい} = complete)\n\nThe key is the second kanji: {製|せい} implies physical manufacturing, while {成|せい} implies completion or formation.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{部品|ぶひん}を{作製|さくせい}する (to manufacture parts)\n・{試作品|しさくひん}を{作製|さくせい}する (to make a prototype)\n・{装置|そうち}を{作製|さくせい}する (to fabricate a device)\n\n[Register: Formal/Technical]",
